sdata> -- design.md sec6.3, ADR-061 (-q variant): interactive-mode statements must
sdata> -- be echoed to screen even under piped/non-tty stdin, where the terminal's
sdata> -- own canonical-mode echo does not apply. Pinned as a direct regression
sdata> -- guard.
sdata> USE MOCK
sdata> LET Z = 5
sdata> PRINT Z
sdata> RUN
sdata> QUIT
